  <section>
    <h2>What You Get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Windows 10/11 app that downloads your AI conversations to Markdown + JSON</li>
      <li>All 8 providers: ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Grok, DeepSeek, Mistral, and Qwen</li>
