  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Still Deciding?</h2>
    <p>Give the free version a try first — it lets you download from a limited set of providers so you can get comfortable with the app. Then unlock everything with a single $24 purchase. See the <a href="/legals/#pricing">Pricing &amp; Free Tier</a> for details.</p>
  </section>

